    "Description":  "AI Blueprint authoring for UE5. Describe gameplay in plain English, get clean working graphs. 6 gameplay templates, smart resolver, custom rules, asset library. BYOK, works with Anthropic API, OpenAI API, Groq, DeepSeek, OpenRouter, Gemini, Claude Pro/Max (via Claude CLI), or ChatGPT Plus/Pro (via Codex CLI). Anonymous opt-out usage telemetry helps improve the plugin.",
